---
import ArrowUpRightIcon from "../icons/ArrowUpRight.astro";
---

{/* No feature list here on purpose: the statement carries the section, and
    anyone who wants the detail has the site one click away. */}
<div class="grid gap-10 lg:grid-cols-12 lg:gap-14">
    <div class="lg:col-span-7" data-reveal>
        <p class="text-pretty text-2xl leading-snug sm:text-3xl">
            An all-in-one HR platform that speeds up the daily running of a
            workforce — automating the painful, repetitive work and shortening
            the processes a company goes through every single day.
        </p>
    </div>

    <div class="lg:col-span-5" data-reveal style="--reveal-delay:80ms">
        <p class="max-w-md text-pretty leading-relaxed text-fg-muted">
            It also hands autonomy back to the people doing the work: a mobile
            app on iOS and Android, and a fixed-terminal mode for sites where
            everyone comes through the same door and clocks in on the way past.
        </p>

        <a
            href="https://horaliahr.com"
            target="_blank"
            rel="noopener noreferrer"
            class="label mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 border-b border-line pb-1 text-fg transition-colors duration-200 hover:border-accent hover:text-accent"
        >
            Visit Horalia
            <ArrowUpRightIcon class="size-3.5" />
        </a>
    </div>
</div>
